    "/venues": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Court Venue"
        ],
        "summary": "/venues",
        "description": "**Query court venue by filter**\n",
        "operationId": "venues-get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/OcpApimSubscriptionKey"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/BearerToken"
          },
          {
            "name": "Filter",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**The filter to search**\n\n**NOTE 1: Concatenate every parameter with 'and'**<br />\n**NOTE 2: Set the value of a filter using 'eq'**<br />\n**NOTE 3: It is not possible to filter by 'ancestors' and 'descendants' at the same time**\n\n**Example 1**:<br />\nlevel eq 2 and ancestors eq true and depth eq 1<br />\n\n**Example 2**:<br />\nlevel eq 1 and descendants eq true and depth eq 2<br />\n\n**Example 3**:<br />\nlabel eq \"Estadual\"<br />\n\n**Example 4**:<br />\ncnj eq 8.05\n\n**Example 5**:<br />\npath eq /4/2/\n\n**Valid options:**<br />\n- **label (string)**: the node name to search<br />\n- **cnj (string)**: cnj number to search<br />\n- **level (integer)**: filter items by level <br />\n- **path (string)**: the path to search <br />\n- **tags (string)**: tags' unique ids separated by comma <br />\n- **depth (integer)**: depth of descendant or ascendents levels to include in the results <br />\n- **uuids (string)**: node's unique ids separated by comma <br /> \n- **ids (string)**: node's ids separated by comma\n- **ancestors (boolean)**: indicates the search for ancestors<br />\n- **descendants (boolean)**: indicates the search for descendants\n",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ListResponse"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "Resources": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Venue"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal Server Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
